  m_Name: Agartha
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Title: 
  Parent: 
  RelativePath: 
  Depth: 0
  IsFolder: 0
  CreateFolder: 0
  Content: "A massive flying fortress created in ancient times by the Obscurian people.
    Incorportated as a self-governing city-state of Armica.\n\nThe structure of Agartha
    is a massive, metallic sphere 25 miles in diameter, flanked by large wing structures.
    The structure is broken into several layered strata broken into two halves: the
    surface layers (broken further into Upper Agartha and Lower Agartha) where the
    majoriy of people live, and the subterranean Ruins. \n\n{br}\nMany of the underlying
    mechanics of Agartha are not yet completely understood However, researchers and
    engineers have managed to restore many of the key functions of the city, including:\n
    \ -Autonomous flight\n  -Internal weather and artificial sunlight control\n  -Atmospheric
    water collection\n\nSuch features have allowed long term colonization and habitation
    of Agartha, primarily by Armican citizens. As of 2030, the city houses over a
    million people."
